OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day for most, with        
OL,6,Fmorning low cloud in inland areas      
OL,7,Ftending to clear, perhaps lingering in 
OL,8,Fthe odd spot. Elsewhere, plenty of     
OL,9,Fsunshine. Feeling much chillier than   
OL,10,FTuesday with a gentle easterly breeze. 
OL,12,CTonight:FCoastal areas will see clear  
OL,13,Fspells tonight, with low cloud further 
OL,14,Finland. It will feel rather cold with  
OL,15,Fwidespread frost developing and the    
OL,16,Fodd freezing fog patch in valleys.     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
