OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CThursday:FAfter a frosty start,        
OL,6,FThursday will be cloudy and dry for    
OL,7,Fmost, and remaining chilly. Overnight  
OL,8,Fa front arrives, bringing wetter,      
OL,9,Fwindier and milder conditions.         
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday   
OL,12,Fand the weekend will likely be         
OL,13,Funsettled with rain and cloud between  
OL,14,Fbrighter spells, and breezy winds near 
OL,15,Fcoasts. Generally chilly inland with   
OL,16,Fovernight frost, but milder near       
OL,17,Fcoasts.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
